<%# locals: (trigger:, title:, body:, button:, path:, method: nil, icon: nil) %>
<%# A destructive action on a record's own page (delete, archive, deactivate): a quiet button that
    asks first, in the page's one confirm dialog (confirm_button, ConfirmHelper). d presses it. %>
<%= confirm_button trigger: trigger, title: title, body: body, button: button, path: path, method: method, icon: icon %>
